      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. One thing I'm worried about is the ambiguity in the wording. The clause mentions \"unforeseeable and uncontrollable events\" but doesn't explicitly list regulatory shifts. In Singaporean law, how strictly is the \"unforeseeability\" of such an event interpreted when it comes to determining if the force majeure clause is actually triggered?",
